<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/style.css">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/htmx.org@1.9.10"></script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="hero">
            <span class="tag">Zen Digital Garden</span>
            <h1><span class="emoji">🦫</span> KapiHome</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">A calm space for aggregating my digital presence through elegant microcards.</p>
        </header>
        
        <main class="content">
            <div class="microcard-grid" id="microcard-container">
                <div class="microcard">
                    <h3>✨ Welcome</h3>
                    <p>Building my digital zen garden, one microcard at a time. This space aggregates my learning journey, projects, and activities in a calm, professional way.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="microcard">
                    <h3>🎯 Philosophy</h3>
                    <p>Not a CV, not a resume. Just snapshots of interests, progress, and creativity. Clean design meets playful accents.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="microcard">
                    <h3>🚀 In Progress</h3>
                    <p>Currently building the infrastructure for dynamic microcards powered by HTMX and FastAPI. Stay tuned for live data from LinkedIn, Exercism, and more.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
    <script src="/static/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
